Subject: Getting a data frame name from d_ply into a ggplot title
Message-ID: <iS5GsisOY8Q.11q1Nsnq-eIJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/manipulatr/c/iS5GsisOY8Q/m/11q1Nsnq-eIJ>
